Package: grace
Title: Dynamic Covariate-Adaptive Randomization for Clinical Trials
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Grace Huiyi", "Ma", role = "aut"),
    person("James W.", "Hardin", email = "jhardin@sc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Randomizes clinical trial participants one at a time into k arms using a
    modified minimal sufficient balance algorithm with weighted balance variables,
    an exact-allocation run-in, and forced allocation at chosen enrollment totals.
    Stores the trial in an encrypted file and simulates operating characteristics.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
